  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "阿瑞 --ā話仙 - 破柴"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 36px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">破柴</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0;\">/ 藍春瑞</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhlWCkHZcYH9ZmX6ubKqHeBT1QjYxnjVMdth01zR2MjgQ79u1mv80hNNtfmxs-Rs0CurKvJnHzJnMois8ACqnkQooWSWnISxzk6T-Adsxy3NvZorxBoxRb_R3BqVnxrglTnVLqdy_HOoUkFJoc1qSKK7k6hGyUusj-21jelJPVJb0GYsdaux9t5Ri3CkGj9\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEibTu-kwGJ6MCb4FGChqT2i46TeCxFan3k_0udafSW8uz_ctyPILouW2nK5FkGA867kuiFxIfGwXPPZw_AlS8HzHbJsC6cpHK-RjnOxaHOWHcUShOlcsf7KHUbgg_kzvu13NMPezzppM3d_B5U0zYKFQbLwIhScZqwiFQ_wPrY7bJ1569RaOII3TEuIe8WR\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: justify; padding: 0 10px;\">\n        園仔內有tsiânn濟家己ta-lian àu--去、tsiah摔落來塗跤兜ê樹le，看<br>tsha̍k-tsha̍k giàng-giàng ê斷喙就知影是hōo風颱掃倒--去--ê，直徑粗--ê有到六七寸，細--ê iáu有兩三寸，來tsia蹛半冬了後，掀tsiok濟專業講柴樹仔ê冊，tsiah沓沓仔bat講tse lóng是山杉、楊桃、銀樺、南洋杉、羅漢松、檨仔、土肉桂、沉香、酪梨、桃花心木、埔姜kah苦楝仔。<br><br>橫橫ke̍h-ke̍h ê柴ue，khah phànn --ê早to hōo白蟻蛀kah kiōng-beh hu --去，khah tīng--ê mā生菇làng-phú beh-àu仔beh-àu，濟kah算bē清，m̄-nā鎮位mā tsiânn ak-tsak。Koh看著對後尾門行--出-去ê柴堆間，有大灶kah一座hiânn柴ê白鐵爐仔，心肝內家己leh暗想，若khioh來hiânn洗身軀水，起火hōo四个人用，免幾khian柴就有夠--ah。舊--ê新--ê kap落去hiânn，決定liōng kah有賰，tsit聲免khai錢買gá-suh koh ē-sái hōo柴箍揣著一步tháu，正經是一空掠雙尾。<br><br>買一大一細ê斧頭仔kah鋸痕iu-iu平平ê日本鋸仔一枝，拄好khai兩千箍圓圓圓。先kā柴ue一尺長鋸hōo一kue̍h一kue̍h，thia̍p hōo齊齊親像牆仔án-ne，排tī爐仔邊手ni ē著ê所在。Khah大箍--ê tio̍h-ài囥起去柴砧kā破--開，一--來柴快ta，二--來細箍khah緊to̍h火。<br> <br>斧頭攑kuân beh破柴箍真正ài小練--一-睏-仔，目睭明明就siòng對柴箍ê正中心，khah ē知影pho̍k一聲隨走精--去，suah tio̍h ke幾若遍工tsiah舞ē好勢；反倒tńg來講，對tshian落手即時li̍h做兩爿就算bē-bái --ah，上suí-khuì--ê是tsit兩塊ê柴爿iáu賰一點仔柴絲牽tiâu--著，伸手去peh就開--開。久--來掠khah ē著破柴ê根節，kah頭起初比--起-來，真正差有夠濟。<br><br>Khah歹pháng--ê是力頭若tsat bē好勢，拄破--開ê柴爿一聲就tuānn對邊--a去，ē飛偌遠lóng bē按算--得，khah-ke mā有人講「beh看人食肉，m̄看人破柴」，道理就是tī tsia。<br><br>一箍一箍鋸齊齊ê直柴，khuè tī柴砧上好破，像講榕仔樹、烏枋樹、巴西鐵樹kah檳榔樹，輕仔出力就pit做兩爿，m̄-koh樟仔kah相思仔ê柴絲tsūn來tsūn去就無thang hiah順--ah；啊若khah tīng身ê白雞油、苦楝舅就歹pháng濟--ah，斧頭仔ài頓幾若下tsiah ē開--開。<br><br>Khiau來khiau去koh分叉ê柴箍就準是phànn柴仔mā tsiânn歹剃頭，khi-khi khuè tī柴砧koh bē四正，tiānn-tiānn m̄知beh按怎落手tsiah是害。Tàn去塗跤siânn白蟻來蛀，兩月日了後àu beh一半去ê時tsūn，用斧頭khing kā摃開顛倒比破--ê koh-khah緊khuì，mā是一步tháu。\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgoptY4vK03vRskmhcL5B9ePRAiAav6Zxrj668QV2EmxF6SQKrv-5F11C-a4UIqKeY8sfELSFVzucQaz1VI-d3B2ElYXTbWhuZqT9BTeL4GaHUjcqCho2r0AdSvrUROIJXwNFiVReFwzuYEJq5aQ9qUkze_8TI5hn_INomHCdAwPcVYYNYrE0nWBhbdVl41\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 387期，2026年06月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br>\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br>\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
